{"source": "help_center", "results": [{"id": "returns-general#when-the-return-window-starts", "title": "Returning an item › When the return window starts", "text": "The return window starts on the delivery date of the shipment the item arrived
in. If your order arrived in more than one shipment, each item has its own
return window.", "effective_date": "2026-10-01"}, {"id": "returns-general#items-you-cannot-return", "title": "Returning an item › Items you cannot return", "text": "Some items are marked "Not returnable" on the product page. Once unsealed,
they cannot be returned for a change of mind (see "Items you cannot return").", "effective_date": "2026-10-01"}, {"id": "returns-non-returnable#how-to-tell", "title": "Items you cannot return › How to tell", "text": "Items that cannot be returned once unsealed are marked "Not returnable" on the
product page, next to the price.", "effective_date": "2026-10-01"}], "note": "Cite results as [kb:<id>]. If none answer the question, say so."}
